 n  #SC floor kappa_SC half-dim kappa_all  obstruction?
 4    2     1        1        2         2  no (=floor)
      cover: free arcs [(0, 1)] (dim 1)
 5    8     3        4        4         4  YES (>floor)
      cover: free arcs [(0, 1), (0, 2), (1, 2), (3, 4)] (dim 4)
